<title>USA: Time Warner nominates Bollenbach to board.</title>
<headline>Time Warner nominates Bollenbach to board.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Time Warner Inc said it has nominated Hilton Hotels Corp chief executive Stephen Bollenbach and UAL Corp chairman Gerald Greenwald for election as directors at its annual meeting to be held on May 15.</p>
<p>Time Warner said Lawrence Buttenwieser, David Kearns and J. Richard Munro will be retiring from the board at that meeting.</p>
<p>As previously announced, Bank of New York chairman J. Carter Bacot has been elected to the Time Warner board. He will fill the seat of one of the retiring directors and will also stand for election at the forthcoming annual meeting.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
